message: "If you use this mechanical design in published work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "mouse-joysticks-mech: two-joystick mechanical assembly"
abstract: >-
  STEP and glTF models of the dual lever assembly in the Janelia Dudman lab
  joystick rig: the two mirrored joystick mechanisms that the
  mouse-joystick-pcb controller boards drive. Mechanical design by Sam Jager;
  repository and documentation by Peter Polidoro.
